{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The baseline is exact on all 16 workloads. The main cost is two FP32 batched GEMMs plus expanded/cast intermediates, so I’m replacing them with native BF16-input/FP32-accumulate contractions and a fused dropout/softmax-backward pass. This keeps the reference’s BF16 inputs and FP32 accumulation while removing the head-expansion copies and most temporary traffic."}}
